    "body": "I started a bit, but there's too many other things to refactor still. So I figured I'd look at the other end. How should we define bitmap more concretely? It seems to have these members if I'm not missing anything:\r\n\r\n* height (integer)\r\n* width (integer)\r\n* data (let's keep that opaque)\r\n* origin-clean (boolean)\r\n* error (boolean)\r\n\r\nCan all bitmaps end up in an error state? Is there anything the above misses?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
